sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant R as Route handler
    participant Q as Quota store
    participant P as AI proxy
    participant M as Model provider
    participant F as Firestore

    B->>R: POST question (session cookie, CSRF)
    R->>R: resolve session, membership, role
    R->>Q: reserve slot (transaction, hourly window)
    alt quota exceeded
        Q-->>R: QUOTA_EXCEEDED
        R-->>B: 429 with reset time
    else reserved
        Q-->>R: reservation held
        R->>P: normalised request
        P->>P: classify intent (search only if current)
        P->>M: open stream
        alt failure before first token
            M-->>P: error
            P->>Q: release reservation
            P-->>R: typed failure (policy, rate, unavailable)
            R-->>B: error, draft preserved, quota not consumed
        else stream started
            loop deltas
                M-->>P: token
                P-->>B: event delta
            end
            P->>Q: settle (idempotent)
            P->>F: persist message and quota effect
            P-->>B: event done
        end
    end
